## 🗂️ 9. Project Structure

```
solar_app_v4/
├── app.py                  # Main Flask application (all routes & API)
├── main.py                 # Entry point (calls app.run)
├── config.yaml             # Roboflow & Google Maps API keys
├── requirements.txt        # Python dependencies
├── .env                    # Environment variables (secret keys)
│
├── templates/
│   ├── index.html          # Home page
│   ├── AIPSI.html          # AI Solar Analysis page
│   ├── Subsidy.html        # Subsidy Calculator
│   ├── process.html        # Application Process flowchart
│   ├── contact.html        # Contact + Live Chat
│   ├── header.html         # Shared navigation header (loaded via XHR)
│   └── footer.html         # Shared footer (loaded via XHR)
│
├── static/
│   ├── css/                # Stylesheets
│   ├── js/
│   │   ├── auth.js         # Authentication helpers
│   │   └── app.js          # Main frontend logic
│   └── annotated/          # Saved annotated images from detection
│
├── app/                    # (Legacy FastAPI app structure, currently unused)
│   ├── models.py           # SQLAlchemy DB models
│   ├── schemas.py          # Pydantic schemas
│   ├── database.py         # DB config
│   ├── dependencies.py     # FastAPI dependency injection
│   ├── routers/            # auth.py, analysis.py route handlers
│   ├── services/           # satellite.py service
│   └── ml_models/          # solar_detector.py
│
├── data/                   # Uploaded CSVs, processed results, cache
├── logs/                   # Application log files
├── results/                # Analysis result files
└── uploads/                # Uploaded images
```

---

## 🔑 10. Configuration & Keys

| Key | Used For |
|---|---|
| `ROBOFLOW_API_KEY` | Authenticates requests to the Roboflow inference API |
| `ROBOFLOW_MODEL_ID` | Specifies the trained solar panel detection model |
| `GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY` | Reserved for Google Maps integration (currently used Esri tiles) |
| `ABLY_API_KEY` | Powers the real-time live chat on the Contact page |
| Formspree endpoint | Handles contact form email submissions |

